{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910423001:1":{"text":"촉수 자식이 실력은 좋더라고. 사냥하는 데 전혀 도와줄 필요가 없더라. 아, 천해족은 건드리지 않았어.","source_cn":"触手男挺厉害，狩猎用不着咱帮忙——咱保证，他没有伤害浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F3FFA7ED58A7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910423002:1":{"text":"난 가만히 있기도 뭐해서 워터라이더를 수리하고 개조할 재료를 잔뜩 찾아왔어. 크흠, 그러다 길에서 소라가 보이길래 겸사겸사 주워 왔어.","source_cn":"闲着也是闲着，咱就去找了不少修理和改装水行器的材料。咳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7C661C023AB7E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910423003:1":{"text":"이건... 타라사에서 꽤 인기 있는 거야.","source_cn":"就是……在塔拉萨挺受欢迎的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D7143CB0D8A579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910423004:1":{"text":"소라? 설마...","source_cn":"海螺？你说的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F08ECBD364D025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910423005:0":{"text":"저, 전에... 네가 네 언니한테 사 달라고 졸랐던 그거.","source_cn":"……就……就你之前在家，缠着你姐想要的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FBA439C064C36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910423006:0":{"text":"자.","source_cn":"喏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFA15317FF279DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"装饰海螺","source_cn":"装饰海螺","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5BDAA27C8B1F9F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910423007:0":{"text":"이건... 회전달 소라잖아?","source_cn":"这是……月旋海螺？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CF2AB80B3DA369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910423008:1":{"text":"산호 군락 깊숙한 곳에서만 찾을 수 있어서 아주 희귀하고 귀하다고 언니가 그랬는데.","source_cn":"姐姐说这种海螺只有在珊瑚丛深处才能找到，很稀少也很珍贵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDF0D7CDF5A50F5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910423009:1":{"text":"톨란, 이거... 일부러 나 주려고 찾아온 거야?","source_cn":"图澜，这个……是特意找来给我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EABACE33001FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910423010:1":{"text":"누, 누가 일부러 찾아왔댔냐? 그냥 개조 재료를 찾다가... 우연히 발견한 거야.","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1910423010":{"text":"누, 누가 일부러 찾아왔댔냐? 그냥 개조 재료를 찾다가... 우연히 발견한 거야.","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910423011:1":{"text":"...야, 덩치! 너...!","source_cn":"……大个子！你——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49A08E9C8437C828","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...야, 덩치! 너...!","female":"...야, 덩치! 너...!","variant_male_record_index":"255545","variant_female_record_index":"255546","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910423012:1":{"text":"응, 알겠어. 소라는 그냥 “우연히” 가져온 거구나.","source_cn":"嗯，我知道了，海螺是你“顺便”带回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17D03E3645ED9460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910423013:0":{"text":"어쨌든 주운 거니까... 너 가져.","source_cn":"总之就捡到了……你拿着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6FAEEE22C6EA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910423014:0":{"text":"진짜 나 주는 거야? 나 이거 정말 좋아하거든. 고마워, 톨란!","source_cn":"真的给我吗？我很喜欢。谢谢你，图澜！","sta